  "notes": "USB audio interface with built-in phono preamp for turntables (LINE/PHONO switch on the input; the input is listed as phono and also accepts line level). Line in/out unbalanced RCA, 3.5 mm stereo headphone jack, USB 1.1 type A (attached cable), bus-powered. Controls from the user manual, chapter 3: LINE/PHONO input switch (PHONO for record players with moving magnet cartridges) and the headphone VOLUME. The app does not yet check whether the switch matches the source. Assumption: VOLUME at MIN is silent; start position PHONO is an app default.",
